      "shape_name": "圆角矩形 44",
      "type": "text",
      "max_chars": 24,
      "source_sample_chars": 9,
      "source_text": "01.市场环境分析",
      "bounds_pt": [
        43.8,
        83.3,
        266.7,
        31.6
      ],
      "semantic_role": "provisional"
    },
    {
      "field": "text_18",
      "shape_id": 18,
      "shape_name": "文本框 17",
      "type": "text",
      "max_chars": 138,
      "source_sample_chars": 69,
      "source_text": "外部扫描：研究宏观经济、行业竞争等，分析市场机会与威胁。\n内部盘点：梳理人力、财力、物力，以及公司技术、品牌、文化，明确核心竞争力与短板。",
      "bounds_pt": [
        48.0,
        133.2,
        262.5,
        88.4
      ],
      "semantic_role": "provisional"
    },
    {
      "field": "text_19",
      "shape_id": 19,
      "shape_name": "圆角矩形 60",
      "type": "text",
      "max_chars": 24,
      "source_sample_chars": 9,
      "source_text": "02.项目目标设定",
      "bounds_pt": [
        43.8,
        471.3,
        266.7,
        31.6
      ],
      "semantic_role": "provisional"
    },
    {
      "field": "text_20",
      "shape_id": 20,
      "shape_name": "文本框 19",
      "type": "text",
      "max_chars": 170,
      "source_sample_chars": 85,
      "source_text": "长期愿景：依环境分析，勾勒 5 - 10 年及更长远发展蓝图，要有前瞻性、激励性。\n短期细化：将长期愿景拆为 1 - 3年可量化的战略目标，明确各业务板块营收、市场份额。",
      "bounds_pt": [
        48.0,
        358.1,
        262.5,
        88.4
      ],
      "semantic_role": "provisional"
    },
    {
      "field": "text_21",
      "shape_id": 21,
      "shape_name": "圆角矩形 46",
      "type": "text",
      "max_chars": 24,
      "source_sample_chars": 9,
      "source_text": "03.制定项目方案",
      "bounds_pt": [
        324.6,
        83.3,
        310.9,
        31.6
      ],
      "semantic_role": "provisional"
    },
    {
      "field": "text_22",
      "shape_id": 22,
      "shape_name": "文本框 21",
      "type": "text",
      "max_chars": 156,
      "source_sample_chars": 78,
      "source_text": "业务战略：确定市场渗透、产品开发、市场开拓或多元化路径，成熟产品靠优化营销渗透。\n职能规划：规划营销、财务、运营战略，提升品牌销量、稳资金流、吸留人才等。​",
      "bounds_pt": [
        324.6,
        133.2,
        308.7,
        88.1
      ],
      "semantic_role": "provisional"
    },
    {
      "field": "text_23",
      "shape_id": 23,
      "shape_name": "圆角矩形 63",
      "type": "text",
      "max_chars": 24,
      "source_sample_chars": 10,
      "source_text": "04.项目评估与跟进",
      "bounds_pt": [
        324.6,
        471.3,
        310.9,
        31.6
      ],
      "semantic_role": "provisional"
    },
    {
      "field": "text_24",
      "shape_id": 24,
      "shape_name": "文本框 23",
      "type": "text",
      "max_chars": 156,
      "source_sample_chars": 78,
      "source_text": "可行性评估：从资源、技术、运营看公司实施战略的人力、物力、财力及技术支撑。​\n风险收益权衡：识别内外部市场、技术等风险，预估收益，选风险可控、收益高方案。​",
      "bounds_pt": [
        324.6,
        358.1,
        308.7,
        88.1
      ],
      "semantic_role": "provisional"
    },
    {
      "field": "text_25",
      "shape_id": 25,
      "shape_name": "圆角矩形 52",
      "type": "text",
      "max_chars": 24,
      "source_sample_chars": 10,
      "source_text": "05.项目细化与配置",
      "bounds_pt": [
        649.4,
        83.3,
        266.7,
        31.6
      ],
      "semantic_role": "provisional"
    },
    {
      "field": "text_26",
      "shape_id": 26,
      "shape_name": "文本框 25",
      "type": "text",
      "max_chars": 154,
      "source_sample_chars": 77,
      "source_text": "行动分解：将战略细化为各阶段任务，明确责任人、时间节点，新产品上市各阶段任务安排。​\n资源配置：按行动规划，合理的去分配人力、财力、物力，保障重点项目。​",
      "bounds_pt": [
        649.4,
        133.2,
        266.7,
        88.1
      ],
      "semantic_role": "provisional"
    },
    {
      "field": "text_27",
      "shape_id": 27,
      "shape_name": "圆角矩形 66",
      "type": "text",
      "max_chars": 24,
      "source_sample_chars": 10,
      "source_text": "06.项目监督与调整",
      "bounds_pt": [
        649.4,
        471.3,
        266.7,
        31.6
      ],
      "semantic_role": "provisional"
    },
    {
      "field": "text_28",
      "shape_id": 28,
      "shape_name": "文本框 27",
      "type": "text",
      "max_chars": 148,
      "source_sample_chars": 74,
      "source_text": "绩效跟踪：建KPI体系，监测营收、市场份额与客户投诉率等，评估战略执行效果。​\n动态调整：依照绩效与环境变化，适时的调整战略，保其适应性、有效性。​",
      "bounds_pt": [
        649.4,
        358.1,
